@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
hide empty description

[*] --> Pending : player or reader edit,\nwith any new IDs fixed
Pending : replayed over the file\nwhenever the document is served
Pending --> Conflict : no longer applies\nto the file
Conflict : not replayed;\ndecided by hand
Pending --> Claimed : agent claims a batch\n(records the file's SHA-256)
Claimed : still replayed while the\nfile has the claimed hash
Claimed --> Written : agent writes\ndocument.json
Written : the file has changed;\nnot replayed again
Written --> Completed : agent completes\nthe batch
Conflict --> Completed : agent completes\nthe batch
Claimed --> Completed : complete unchanged, only if\nnot_adopted, comment or review-request
Pending --> [*] : discarded by\nthe player
Completed : outcome: applied, already_correct,\nnot_adopted or reviewed
Completed --> [*]
@enduml
